<title>POLAND: Paged Q2 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Paged Q2 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paged preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.43   vs     3.44</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.80   vs     3.64</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.17   vs     2.13</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Paged SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     28.48   vs    24.95</p>
<p>    costs of sales			15.90   vs    13.19</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs     0.10</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.63   vs     1.51</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.84   vs     3.36</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.51   vs     3.06</p>
<p>    investment			     2.84   vs     6.43</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     4.32   vs     4.93</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.71   vs     6.17</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.87   vs     3.78</p>
<p>    net sales			     55.66   vs    49.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			31.04   vs    27.27</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   1.33   vs     0.10</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.84   vs     2.39</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   5.77   vs     9.88</p>
<p>    financial costs			3.04   vs     8.54</p>
<p>    investment			     2.99   vs     7.24</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
